          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jerome-behuet-vuyudels3jw-unsplash.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "Documents",
          "text": "Due to the nature of our client’s programs, we are only able to consider candidates who have prepared themselves for a proper yacht job.  Although each program may have their additional needs and requirements, all positions we work require the following:<br>(1)\tA CV written in English that is both professional and concise (it does not have to be perfect…but it must be good)<br>(2)\tSTCW Basic Training (all 4 modules)<br>(3)\tMedical Fit for Duty - seagoing<br>(4)\tThe license you claim on your CV  <br>(5)\tVerifiable references (yes we do call them, no we will not tell you what they say)<br>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "msg-box5",
          "_anchor": "msg-box5-51",
          "_params": {
            "showTitle": true,
            "showText": true,
            "showButtons": false,
            "inverse": true,
            "imageSize": 50,
            "paddingTop": 0,
            "paddingBottom": 0,
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "bgImage": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/jumbotron.jpg",
            "parallax": true,
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "bgColor": "#fff",
            "bgVideoRadio": false,
            "bgVideo": {
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw"
            },
            "overlay": false,
            "overlayColor": "#fff",
            "overlayOpacity": 0.5
          },
          "media": {
            "image": {
              "active": true,
              "width": 1400,
              "src": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/willian-justen-de-vasconcellos-g5fyzvizus4-unsplash.jpg",
              "link": "",
              "alt": "",
              "title": "",
              "linkInNewWindow": false
            },
            "video": {
              "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq7p44IA-1U",
              "aspectratio": "16:9",
              "autoplay": false,
              "loop": false
            },
            "iconFont": {
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-msg-box5",
              "link": "",
              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "Onboard Experience",
          "text": "Deck / Stew candidates – at least 5 months on one yacht (freelance time does not count), we do not “stack” time from numerous yachts.<br><br>Experienced Deck / Stew candidates – at least a full contract on one yacht (10+ months)<br><br>Bosun / Second Stew candidates – at least two years as an Experienced Deck / Stew<br><br>Mate / Chief Stew candidates – varies by program, but solid experience as a Bosun or Second Stew with proven longevity in that role.<br><br>Captain / Chief Engineer – if you have to ask, you don’t qualify.<br>",
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
        },
        {
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
