              "name": "desktop",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title1": "And if I go on an interview and after the interview don’t want the job?",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "If they offer the job, just turn them down politely and professionally – and tell us why.  The entire point of the interview is so that both sides can see if the fit will be a good one.  Trust us when we tell you that if the Captain or Owner does not think you are a good fit, they will have no problem telling you “no”.<br>",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "If I turn down a bunch of jobs from you, will you stop contacting me?",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "<span style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Only if we are bringing you jobs that are what you claim to want, but you still turn them all down.  It indicates either we are not understanding your needs…or that you are not confident in what you are seeking.</span><br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "How do I get you to stop contacting me?",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "Just ask us to stop.  We’d hate to see you leave our group, but we get it that we are not for everybody.  And please know that we are only going to contact you a few times a year to check in with you or to bring you opportunities, or to ask you for references on people who give us your name as a references.  We will not bombard you with useless email or phone calls.  We all hate SPAM.<br>",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "I am a great crewmember – but not such a good CV writer.  Will you write my CV for me?",
          "subtitle4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop",
          "caption4": "<span style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;\">No.  We’ll give you tips that we’ve gleaned over the years – go to our <a href=\"http://www.preferredcrew.com/tips.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-info\">TIPS</a> page, but we will not write your CV.  In fact, it is important that your CV be in your voice, so we will not correct spelling or grammar either.</span><br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
