          "title1": "How do I check in with you?",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "You don’t.  As far as we are concerned, as long as you don’t tell us to remove your file, you are interested in our bringing you options that are in line with your career goals.<br>",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "But what if I’m working?",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "<span style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;\">When we check in with you, or when we send you a potential spot, just tell us.  We’ll mark you happy but we will still want to bring you things that make sense….maybe touching base with you the next season.  We really do want to hear about your success even if they are not from us and we always want to know if you get promoted or score a new license!&nbsp;</span><br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "Will you bring me jobs even after you place me?",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "No.  That is just not right.  If we place you, we collect a fee from that owner.  It would not be honest for us to bring you a job until after you give notice to that program.  We will stay in contact, but not bring you jobs until you give notice.<br>",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "Why won’t you tell me the name of the boat that you are presenting me?",
          "subtitle4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop",
          "caption4": "<span style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;\">There are a number of reasons we keep the name confidential.  First, if the Captain or Owner wants us to keep the name confidential – then we do.  There are a number of reasons why the program will want to keep the name under wraps and there is no way to cover them all here.  We will give you a decent description of the job.  If it turns out that you have already been presented by another source, don’t worry about it – that is part of our business.&nbsp;</span><br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
