          "title1": "I don't see any Seasonal or Temporary jobs on your site",
          "subtitle1": "Bootstrap 4 has been noted",
          "caption1": "The truth is we get maybe one or two of these a season - at most. &nbsp;So when we get a short term spot, we bring it to full time crew who might be looking for some fill in work. &nbsp;We don't work with part time or seasonal jobs or crew.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "What happens after I send you my documents?",
          "subtitle2": "One of Bootstrap 4's big points",
          "caption2": "We read your CV completely, examine and confirm your documents then, if we believe we can represent you to clients, we will either accept you application as complete or we may ask you for additional information and request a time to chat.<br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "Ok - so exactly what documents do you need?",
          "subtitle3": "Google has a highly exhaustive list of fonts",
          "caption3": "1. A Yachting CV<br>2. STCW &nbsp;First Aid<br>3.STCW &nbsp;Fire Fighting<br>4. STCW PSSR<br>5. STCW PST<br>6. Security Training<br>7. Medical Fit for Duty<br>8. Your Largest Deck and/or Engine License<br>9. Any written references you want us to have.<br>&nbsp;Nothing else - please nothing else.....<br>Each document must be under 2 MB and for the love of all that is holy, please scan them so that they are right-side up.<br>.<br>",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "I'm in Fort Lauderdale right now, can I just stop in?",
          "subtitle4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop",
          "caption4": "Unfortunately no. As we are such a small agency, we do require an appointment for any meeting. We don’t accept walk-ins.<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
