          "title": "Our mission",
          "meta": "We strive to service clients with the same quality that you expect from your on-board team.  Our vision for assisting you in sourcing candidates is to develop a long-term partnership with you.  We understand that your yacht or ship is unique and requires a team that works best for you.  We do not believe that any position in this industry is one-size-fits-all.  ",
