          },
          "title1": "Jovana Dulovic",
          "subtitle1": "Associate",
          "caption1": "When Preferred Crew decided to expand into Europe our concern was finding a great recruiter who would understand our culture.  Yachting we can teach, but somebody who can have fun with the work….that was something we knew was a must.<br><br>Jovana Dulovic was a hit from the first introduction.  A solid, experienced land-based recruiter, Jovana’s background combined traditional recruitment with personality and psychological underpinnings helping people find that “right fit.”  Jovana listens to candidates and is happy going “off script” getting a more holistic view of the candidate – not just a page of facts. <br> <br>Excited about Jumping into yachting, Jovana quickly found the amazing variety of people engaging.  Exploring crew perspectives, expectations and preferences – She was stunned at the level of excitement, adventure and incredible levels of service that define the very best in yacht crew.<br><br>Jovana’s style can only be described as highly professional and results oriented, but peppered with solid encouragement and an informal, conversation style, she is described as “easy to talk to.”<br>.",
