          },
          "title1": "Interview Tip From Ian",
          "subtitle1": "February 19",
          "caption1": "When we interview Green Crew, we want to know that you have done a bit of research into yachting. We will ask you to tell us a story that you have heard that makes you think you will like yachting (no names). Get in front of that question – start asking employed yacht crew what they have experienced aboard that they really enjoyed! Ask that follow up question too – what they have experienced that they would prefer not to go through again.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "Career Tip From Ian",
          "subtitle2": "February 6",
          "caption2": "Don’t work for a bad boss. They set the tone, tomorrow will not be different",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "Career Tip From Ian",
          "subtitle3": "January 9",
          "caption3": "Don’t quit a job because of a bad day. Tomorrow will be different",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "Interview Tip From Ian",
          "subtitle4": "December 18",
          "caption4": "When going into an interview think of what they are seeking. If the post is for a Bosun, there is not a lot of value in your extolling how much you would love to be a Yoga Instructor. But when they ask about your hobbies, or what you do for fun – roll it out then!<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title6": "Host Anywhere",
          "subtitle6": "Don't limit yourself to just one platform",
          "caption6": "Publish your website to a local drive, FTP or host on Amazon S3, Google Drive, Github. Don't limit yourself to just one platform or service provider.",
          "button6": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
