          },
          "title4": "Career Tip from Ian",
          "subtitle4": "November 10",
          "caption4": "Yachting is world-wide…but the community is realitively small. It may be satisfying to \"tell off\" your current Captain / Chief / etc. but is it really worth the long term damage? When you leave a program, leave on the best terms possible. (I was on  a trip - moving to November)<br>",
