          "subtitle1": "November 8",
          "caption1": "Skills that will assist in your landing your first yacht job: show up early every day, clear eyed, smile on your face. Work long, hard, hot hours. Non-comlaining, no whining, no time spent on Instagram / FaceBook or TikTok.",
