              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "Career Tip from Ian",
          "subtitle4": "October 11",
          "caption4": "Deck crew have Mate and Master Tickets, Engineers have the \"Y\" &amp; \"SV\" Tickets, Interior and Galley have guest experience letters/references. We all have paperwork to back up our skills and abilities, don't ever stop growing them.<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
