          "title1": "Interview Tip From Ian",
          "subtitle1": "August 16, 2023",
          "caption1": "How do you negotiate wages? Do not try to figure out what everybody else earns, there is no such thing as \"industry standard\". Instead, add up your monthly bills, add that to the amount you need to put away each month to meet your retirement goals and then add on what you need to spend each month to enjoy your life. That is your minimum number.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
