          "title1": "CV tip from Ian<br><span style=\"color: inherit; line-height: 1.2825; font-weight: normal;\"><i>Jun 21, 2023</i></span><br><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Stop wasting your time “tweaking” your CV every day. Communicate clearly what you are bringing to the table – nobody cares if you change the color of the font….but when you find an error in that CV, change it immediately!</span>",
          "subtitle1": "",
          "caption1": "",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "Interview tip from Jovana",
          "subtitle2": "January 19, 2023",
          "caption2": "Your interview is your first impression, never show up late. It is better to be 15 minutes early than 1 minute late.",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "",
          "subtitle3": "",
          "caption3": "<b>CV tip from Ian</b><br>January 16, 2023<br><br>If you are writing your CV in English, make sure to use an English spell check, then have a friend review it as well to check the grammar and “voice” of your CV. This is your professional snapshot – not a text to your friends. Avoid jargon and abbreviations!",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "Expectations tip from Jovana",
          "subtitle4": "June 27, 2022",
          "caption4": "There is no such thing as \"industry starndard\". Each client sets his own conditions based on their needs and budget. When asked about financial expectations, feel free to speak up and bring precise numbers. That's how you will avoid getting offers that are payed below your expecxtations. <br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title6": "Host Anywhere",
          "subtitle6": "Don't limit yourself to just one platform",
          "caption6": "Publish your website to a local drive, FTP or host on Amazon S3, Google Drive, Github. Don't limit yourself to just one platform or service provider.",
          "button6": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise3"
