          "title1": "Interview Tip from Jovana",
          "subtitle1": "June 14, 2022",
          "caption1": "When describing yourself in a cover letter, in your CV or during the interview, try to avoid cliché descriptions: team player, hardworking etc. We want to learn what your specificity is, what makes you unique and what extra value you bring to the team you join.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "Attitude Tip from Ian",
          "subtitle2": "May 23, 2022",
          "caption2": "Rejection is a part of the job hunt / interview process. &nbsp;We all know it is difficult to take, but it is as real as the sea. &nbsp;When &nbsp;your application is rejected, put a smile on your face, keep a great attitude and move on.<br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "CV Tip from Nelly",
          "subtitle3": "May 16, 2022",
          "caption3": "Consider ditching your objective if you have one. &nbsp;They really are not necessary, especially if they are too specfic",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "I'm in Fort Lauderdale right now, can I just stop in?",
          "subtitle4": "Mobirise gives you the freedom to develop",
          "caption4": "Unfortunately no. As we are such a small agency, we do require an appointment for any meeting. We don’t accept walk-ins.<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
