          },
          "title1": "<p>Interview Tip from Jovana</p>",
          "subtitle1": "April 18, 2022",
          "caption1": "If you are a bit nervous, it is ok. Share that with the interviewer or make a joke out of it. Both things can help you feel better and present yourself in the best light.",
          "button1": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media2": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "mobile",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title2": "CV Tip from Ian",
          "subtitle2": "April 15, 2022",
          "caption2": "Do not forget to add your photo to your CV. In yachting, you will likely be interviewed over the phone before you are called in for a face to face interview. The photo should be how you will appear in your interview, properly dressed, no sunglasses, no drinks in hand, no friends cut out of the photo, no selfies. Proper attire, happy face!<br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media3": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "pencil",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title3": "Interview Tip from Jovana",
          "subtitle3": "April 11, 2022",
          "caption3": "Whether you are having SKYPE/Zoom/Google meet, dress up properly. Avoid hats, sunglasses, sleeveless shirts, belly revealing shirts etc...<br>",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media4": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title4": "CV Tip from Ian",
          "subtitle4": "April 8, 2022",
          "caption4": "There is no “rule” about how long a CV should be….but the rule is “the shorter the better.” Don’t waste time being repetitious. Do not say: “I am seeking a permanent or temporary position as Deckhand on a Charter or Private yacht, Motor or Sail, around 50m bigger or smaller.” When saying “I am seeking a Deckhand position” says the exact same thing.<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media5": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
          "title5": "Trendy Website Blocks",
          "subtitle5": "Choose from the large selection of blocks",
          "caption5": "Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks - jumbotrons, hero images, parallax scrolling, video backgrounds, hamburger menu, sticky header and more.",
          "button5": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">MORE</a>",
          "media6": {
            "iconFont": {
              "active": true,
              "class": "mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-features2",
              "name": "global",
              "link": "https://mobirise.com",
              "size": 0,
              "family": "et-line"
            }
          },
