          },
          "title4": "CV tip from Ian",
          "subtitle4": "March 14, 2022",
          "caption4": "If you are writing your CV in English, make sure to use an English spell check, then have a friend review it as well to check the grammar and “voice” of your CV. This is your professional snapshot – not a text to your friends. Avoid jargon and abbreviations!<br>",
